        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Your Own Decks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own personalized study decks with ease. Whether you prefer typing out notes, sketching diagrams, or uploading images, the choice is yours. Tailor your learning experience to match your style and make studying more effective and engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/599b42a4424ae9fb1fccfeaddc786c6b.poster.avif?t=1756300768\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/599b42a4424ae9fb1fccfeaddc786c6b.webm?t=1756300768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/599b42a4424ae9fb1fccfeaddc786c6b.mp4?t=1756300768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Study with Multiple Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a variety of study modes designed to support different approaches to learning. From methods that encourage consistency to those that focus on quick challenges, there’s something for everyone. Stay motivated with tools that adapt to your needs and preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/83e7a44105d3b6eada9dd16db4058537.poster.avif?t=1756300768\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/83e7a44105d3b6eada9dd16db4058537.webm?t=1756300768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/83e7a44105d3b6eada9dd16db4058537.mp4?t=1756300768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn Flashes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card you study earns you &quot;flashes,&quot; the in-game currency. Use them to unlock cosmetics, daily challenges, or activate the pomodoro timer for focused study sessions.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your study game with upgrades that enhance your &quot;flashes&quot; and XP gains. These boosts keep you engaged and motivated, making it easier to hit your learning milestones. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/e0029b31185f453280a79b9f66824222.poster.avif?t=1756300768\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/e0029b31185f453280a79b9f66824222.webm?t=1756300768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/e0029b31185f453280a79b9f66824222.mp4?t=1756300768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your cards truly your own by spending &quot;flashes&quot; on cosmetic upgrades. Add flair and personality to your study decks, turning every session into a visually enjoyable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/aa27ef6336d89098d1f8c758af1cabfc.poster.avif?t=1756300768\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/aa27ef6336d89098d1f8c758af1cabfc.webm?t=1756300768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/aa27ef6336d89098d1f8c758af1cabfc.mp4?t=1756300768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make Studying Enjoyable</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t just studying--it’s an adventure. With creative tools, engaging modes, and plenty of customization options, this game transforms learning into something you’ll actually look forward to. Why just study when you can play and learn at the same time?  </p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Your Own Decks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own personalized study decks with ease. Whether you prefer typing out notes, sketching diagrams, or uploading images, the choice is yours. Tailor your learning experience to match your style and make studying more effective and engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/599b42a4424ae9fb1fccfeaddc786c6b.poster.avif?t=1756300768\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/599b42a4424ae9fb1fccfeaddc786c6b.webm?t=1756300768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/599b42a4424ae9fb1fccfeaddc786c6b.mp4?t=1756300768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Study with Multiple Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a variety of study modes designed to support different approaches to learning. From methods that encourage consistency to those that focus on quick challenges, there’s something for everyone. Stay motivated with tools that adapt to your needs and preferences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/83e7a44105d3b6eada9dd16db4058537.poster.avif?t=1756300768\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/83e7a44105d3b6eada9dd16db4058537.webm?t=1756300768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/83e7a44105d3b6eada9dd16db4058537.mp4?t=1756300768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earn Flashes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card you study earns you &quot;flashes,&quot; the in-game currency. Use them to unlock cosmetics, daily challenges, or activate the pomodoro timer for focused study sessions.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your study game with upgrades that enhance your &quot;flashes&quot; and XP gains. These boosts keep you engaged and motivated, making it easier to hit your learning milestones. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/e0029b31185f453280a79b9f66824222.poster.avif?t=1756300768\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/e0029b31185f453280a79b9f66824222.webm?t=1756300768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/e0029b31185f453280a79b9f66824222.mp4?t=1756300768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your cards truly your own by spending &quot;flashes&quot; on cosmetic upgrades. Add flair and personality to your study decks, turning every session into a visually enjoyable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/aa27ef6336d89098d1f8c758af1cabfc.poster.avif?t=1756300768\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/aa27ef6336d89098d1f8c758af1cabfc.webm?t=1756300768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900070/extras/aa27ef6336d89098d1f8c758af1cabfc.mp4?t=1756300768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make Studying Enjoyable</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t just studying--it’s an adventure. With creative tools, engaging modes, and plenty of customization options, this game transforms learning into something you’ll actually look forward to. Why just study when you can play and learn at the same time?  </p>",
